@startuml

== Perform BIM checking or extraction or XKT generation ==
Frontend -> Lupapiste: Call command
Lupapiste -> Mongo: Create job
Lupapiste -> PubSub: Send BIM request
Lupapiste -> Frontend: Return job id
PubSub --> "Bimmer/Lupapiste": Receive BIM request
"Bimmer/Lupapiste" --> "BIM service"
"BIM service" --> "Bimmer/Lupapiste"
"Bimmer/Lupapiste" -> PubSub: Send BIM response
PubSub --> Lupapiste: Receive BIM response
Lupapiste -> Mongo: Update job status
Lupapiste -> Mongo: Store BIM results

== Polling for BIM results ==
Frontend -> Lupapiste: Poll job with id
Mongo -> Lupapiste: Job status
Mongo --> Lupapiste: BIM results
Lupapiste -> Frontend: Return status

@enduml

